ame><surname>Ross</surname><given-names>DA</given-names></name><name><surname>Mosha</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Obasi</surname><given-names>AI</given-names></name><name><surname>Plummer</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Balira</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Grosskurth</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Mabey</surname><given-names>DC</given-names></name><name><surname>Hayes</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The sexual health of pupils in years 4 to 6 of primary schools in rural Tanzania</article-title><source>Sex Transm Infect</source><year>2004</year><volume>80</volume><fpage>35</fpage><lpage>42</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14755033</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1136/sti.2003.005413</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B32"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Plummer</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Wigth</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Wamoyi</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Ross</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Salamba</surname><given-names>Z</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Sexual violence, pressure and HIV in Rural Mwanza, Tanzania. International AIDS Society: </article-title><source>In the 14th International AIDS Conference Barcelona, Spain 14: (Abstract no WeOrE1282), 7th-12 July, 2002</source><year>2002</year></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>